source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Runs the game and writes the last frame

Usage: leptoskit game run [OPTIONS] [PATH]

Arguments:
  [PATH]  The game directory. Defaults to `game/lantern` when that crate is here, otherwise the current directory

Options:
      --release            Build in release mode
      --frames <FRAMES>    Fixed steps to run. Each step is one frame
      --out <OUT>          Where to write the last frame
      --hold <HOLD>        An action held for every tick. Repeat for several
      --tap <TAP>          Press the control with this label halfway through the run
      --width <WIDTH>      Frame width in pixels
      --height <HEIGHT>    Frame height in pixels
      --painter <PAINTER>  `auto` (default), `gpu`, or `cpu`
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
